'''Moby Dick''' (ホゲーー, ''Hogēe'') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Moby Dick|Unit Defense Up (Sm)|Fisherman Cat|Whale Cat|Crazed Whale Cat|jpname=ホゲーー}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This Cat Combo is a reference to Herman Melville's novel ''[[wikipedia:Moby Dick|Moby Dick]]'', the plot of which centers around Captain Ahab's attempts of retribution against the titular whale that he lost a leg to.

